      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BOTH BULLETS (7) missed the frame and was safely held latest finishing 6th at Bulli following on from a second place finish (22.56) there the start prior. Form here at the trip sound including two wins. The form from her last run stacks up well. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. QUEEN CHRISSY (1) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing sixth (23.83) in a Grade 5 at this track. Comes out of a solid form race last start. Great chance to atone. THREE HUNDRED (2) was an all the way winner two back scoring by a space but last start could manage only a minor placing when a 3 length second at this track (18.63). Goes well out of this box with a win and three minor placings. Expected to feature again. WINGED RUPEE (3) has strong claims after a top-three finish in good time last time out.",
